      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There is no VFX graph support for the BIRP, it requires a scriptable pipeline like the HDRP or the URP to be used. It would be a nice feature, but I can't imagine this is worthwhile until Unity drops support for the BIRP.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
