  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-06-07T14:53:46.701Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The Visual Effect component/VFX Graph introduced in Unity 2019 is an extremely powerful tool for animators and VFX artists alike. Animation sequences are already powered by node-based State Machines, and with the VFX Graph it would be much the same. Node-based VFX would allow for increased optimization by cutting down on particle system counts DRAMATICALLY on VFX-heavy or animation based avatars.",
